_at":"2015-07-08T20:24:28Z","body":"I have been looking at this quite a bit.\n\nIn the VariableDeclaration function, the `lastVariableName` is assigned to `memo.id.name`;\n\nIt looks like when a something is below is declared,\n\n``` javascript\nconst sounds = {dog: 'woof'};\nconst {dog} = sounds;\n```\n\nthe node param comes in as an `ObjectPattern` type. The `memo.id` itself is an array of \"Property\" objects with a key object and a value object. The `name` property resides within the key and value objects and doesn't actually have the `name` property. I am unsure of the complete intended portion of this code so I haven't found a good solution to this.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/119719171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"TheBubbleDuck","id":6233164,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzMxNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6233164?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck","html_url":"https://github.com/TheBubbleDuck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheBubbleDuck/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":351214482,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM1MTIxND